          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Patient reports mildly itchy red patches on the upper chest and upper back for approximately 10–14/7, with mild intermittent pruritus worse with heat and sweat. OTC aloe provides partial relief. Denies blistering, skin breakdown, mucosal involvement, and photosensitivity."
      }
